{
    "background_story": "Malia was a talented and ambitious college student, always striving to be at the top of her class. However, as the pressure to succeed mounted, she found herself tempted by the easy way out. She began to cheat on her exams, copying answers from her classmates and plagiarizing papers from the internet. At first, Malia rationalized her actions, telling herself that everyone else was doing it too. But as the semester wore on, her guilt and anxiety grew. She became isolated from her friends and family, unable to shake the feeling that she was living a lie. When her professor discovered her cheating, Malia was forced to confront the consequences of her actions. She was expelled from the university, her reputation tarnished. Malia's story serves as a cautionary tale about the dangers of cheating and the importance of integrity.",
